MaterialsTable [SimTalk] - ContinuousMixer
Sets the MaterialsTable which contains the final product and the details of the ingredients of each
FluidSource such as ratio/density/color, which the ContinuousMixer designated by <Path> can mix.
Syntax
<Path>.MaterialsTable:path
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type path.
Example
MyContinuousMixer.MaterialsTable := MyMaterialsTable
See also
Materials Table [Mixer], object
MaterialsTable [SimTalk] - ContinuousMixer
Plant Simulation Help 11-2879
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

Product [SimTalk] - ContinuousMixer
Sets the name of the intermediate or of the finished product which the ContinuousMixer designated by
<Path> is to produce by mixing the ingredients.
Remarks
The name of this Product has to be defined in the MaterialsTable.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.Product:string
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type string.
Example
MyContinuousMixer.Product := "MyProduct"
See also
Product [text box] - Mixer
Materials Table [Mixer]
Portioner
Portioner
Use the object Portioner to create a mobile object out of a free-flowing product. You can then connect the
Portioner with one of the material flow objects to further process the created MUs.
